    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if there's anything that can help. it just feels like everything's already been said and done. i look at the neighbors and see them living, but i just feel like a ghost in my own house. it's more like i'm just waiting for the inevitable to finally happen so i can stop this constant, heavy waiting.",
